# The files of support/cryptography that the system wrote itself: the
# compatibility layer, the files in the place of a hardware dispatch of the
# origin, and the tests (docs/CRYPTOGRAPHY.md, section 3). Each line: the
# file, the BLAKE3 hash of the file. `kerneltool cryptography-origin` (also in
# `kerneltool check`) checks each hash, and that each .odin file of
# support/cryptography is in this list or in origin.manifest. After a review
# of a change, `kerneltool cryptography-system-hashes` prints the new lines.
